{"id":"ccbc15:problem:3-17","answer":"MEDICINE","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>这些吧唧都是国内不同高校校徽的一部分，你需要尝试找出它们对应的高校。</p>","text":"这些吧唧都是国内不同高校校徽的一部分，你需要尝试找出它们对应的高校。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"我大概知道这些是什么，但有些也太难辨认了吧","html":"<p>上一提示提到的东西，在地理位置上非常接近，希望这能帮助你很快找齐所有信息。</p>","text":"上一提示提到的东西，在地理位置上非常接近，希望这能帮助你很快找齐所有信息。","assetIds":[]},{"number":3,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>根据方位解双手旗语。</p>","text":"根据方位解双手旗语。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>观察可发现这些徽章的元素都来自广州大学城的大学校徽</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-e451d6279d3d2bc7a2a14ebc\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/3/3579171c6c9a464b8fd7f2077c3df3d0.webp\" width=\"500\"/></p>\n<p>根据校徽对应学校方位解双手旗语，得到答案<strong>MEDICINE</strong></p>","text":"观察可发现这些徽章的元素都来自广州大学城的大学校徽\n\n根据校徽对应学校方位解双手旗语，得到答案\nMEDICINE","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-e451d6279d3d2bc7a2a14ebc"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem","content-type":0},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-e451d6279d3d2bc7a2a14ebc","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/3/3579171c6c9a464b8fd7f2077c3df3d0.webp","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/3/3579171c6c9a464b8fd7f2077c3df3d0.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":806050,"sha256":"2eb0f34705920cb99c20c795ad52a9b601a20c9381a10bf695c5ae20cb50f63f","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
